        {
          "text": "Ali ni lilamusi lya wiwu naga jwamlume asimonjile kuti ŵamkwakwe atesile cikululu. Jwamkongwe tacimjimika pasogolo pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi, nipo jwakutaga mbopesi tacitenda wele msyunguwu. ",
